   "source": [
    "## Step 1: Identifier Type Casting & Text Standardization\n",
    "\n",
    "### Actions:\n",
    "1. Convert `inpatient_number` from `int64` to `str` to ensure consistent keys when merging with Demography and Clinical tables.\n",
    "2. Strip unexpected leading/trailing whitespaces from `drug_name` strings to prevent text formatting mismatches."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 142,
   "id": "839c62d8-025f-4f52-b20a-f3dae0dfa35f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
